<title>USA: MBIA has capacity for Orange Cty, Calif., pensions.</title>
<headline>MBIA has capacity for Orange Cty, Calif., pensions.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>MBIA Insurance Corp said Thursday it has a limited supply of remaining secondary market insurance capacity for Orange County, Calif., pension obligation series A bonds.</p>
<p>MBIA's said its secondary market insurance for the bonds, dated 9/1/94, is available on a first-come, first-served basis. For more information, call 800-624-2669.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
